WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:05.270
SALMA HAYEK
Oh my God, I have so many.

00:00:05.321 --> 00:00:06.548
Does it have to be three?

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:09.989
KUMAIL NANJIANI
The heart emoji, the shades emoji,

00:00:10.039 --> 00:00:11.894
and then the strong arm one.

00:00:12.391 --> 00:00:15.237
LIA MCHUGH
The old lady emoji, the shushing emoji,

00:00:15.287 --> 00:00:17.084
and the robot emoji.

00:00:17.631 --> 00:00:18.729
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
The smiley face with the little

00:00:18.779 --> 00:00:22.958
sweat drop at the side,
eyes-rolled-up emoji, the flowers emoji?

00:00:23.009 --> 00:00:24.620
PHASTOS
I'm sure that was a lot of fun for you.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:25.318
THENA
It was.

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:27.775
LAUREN RIDLOFF (in sign language)
The running woman emoji.

00:00:27.825 --> 00:00:32.823
The book emoji.
And a French fries emoji.

00:00:33.307 --> 00:00:35.929
GEMMA CHAN
Beer emoji, the sleeping emoji,

00:00:35.979 --> 00:00:37.772
and the kind of grimacing emoji.

00:00:37.822 --> 00:00:39.238
PHASTOS
You know what's never saved the planet?

00:00:39.288 --> 00:00:40.106
Your sarcasm.

00:00:40.156 --> 00:00:43.429
SALMA HAYEK
Only three emojis. I could do 20 emojis.

00:00:43.961 --> 00:00:46.463
DON LEE
Heart, biceps, and fist emojis.

00:00:47.312 --> 00:00:48.793
BARRY KEOGHAN
The Irish flag emoji,

00:00:48.843 --> 00:00:51.078
shamrock emoji, and wolf emoji.

00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:53.778
SALMA HAYEK
There is one that is kind of, like,

00:00:53.829 --> 00:00:59.927
a ball of fire, a horse,
and, uh... a volcano.

00:01:00.544 --> 00:01:01.643
AJAK
It is time.

00:01:01.693 --> 00:01:02.923
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Marvel Studios' Eternals

00:01:02.974 --> 00:01:04.361
is in theaters November 5th.

00:01:04.411 --> 00:01:05.857
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Book your tickets today.

